00:32:08,846 --> 00:32:11,904
Can you tell me the exact process that you did?

356
00:32:12,704 --> 00:32:17,184
And right off the bat, it's going to be really fast because it's already loaded in its context.

357
00:32:17,264 --> 00:32:18,788
So it doesn't have to search anything up.

358
00:32:19,104 --> 00:32:25,344
It already remembers within the context, because this wasn't that long ago, how it achieved that.

