00:32:36,064 --> 00:32:41,412
And this is significantly faster than going through the Unreal MCP.

361
00:32:41,838 --> 00:32:53,504
Because if it had to use the MCP, they would have to load up the Unreal Engine, wait for the MCP server to start, and then go through all the different MCP tools, pick out what it needs.

362
00:32:53,584 --> 00:32:55,396
And that is just such a slow process.

363
00:32:55,854 --> 00:33:00,464
Remember, modern LLMs are insanely good at programming.

364
00:33:00,654 --> 00:33:09,956
It's a lot faster for the AI to write a Python script to then grab that data directly, analyze it, and then throw away the Python script.

365
00:33:10,830 --> 00:33:12,224
